ypically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSuggestionChip"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip"}}}